/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Definition: SIM is a system that focuses on the long-term storage, analysis, and reporting of security data. It enables organizations to retain historical security information and use it for compliance reporting, forensics, and in-depth analysis of past incidents.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
